WEBVTT

00:00:04.028 --> 00:00:05.028
The twilight has come.

00:00:05.756 --> 00:00:07.636
Even if the darkness swallows everything

00:00:08.412 --> 00:00:09.352
Deep in my heart

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.300
O stardust that continues to twinkle!

00:00:12.924 --> 00:00:14.924
Like Asahi, now, burn up!

00:00:15.996 --> 00:00:17.996
Thank you for watching!

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:38.510
Thank you.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:00.480
Got it.

00:01:49.164 --> 00:01:53.824
I, Rina Inverse, and my guardian, Gauri, have been involved in a mysterious incident.

00:01:53.900 --> 00:02:00.000
They say it's to save the mysterious city of Taforashi, but what does it mean to make me wet?

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:01.660
And the reason is because it's the Rina Inverse!

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:06.280
On top of that, even suspicious assassins and noble old ladies are aiming for their lives!

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:10.280
And finally, that legendary demon beast Zanaffar is revived with a big commotion!

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:12.040
I can't stand it anymore!

00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:19.240
If I get this Rina Inverse, I thought that the opponent would be a legendary demon beast or something, but I was wrong at first sight!

00:02:20.770 --> 00:02:22.890
There are still a lot of mysteries!

00:02:23.190 --> 00:02:25.200
Well then, what will happen next?

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:27.470
Newcomer!

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:38.640
Yes, sir.

00:03:25.884 --> 00:03:26.724
Thank you.

00:03:27.356 --> 00:03:27.856
Eh?

00:03:43.244 --> 00:03:44.424
Did you understand something?

00:03:44.556 --> 00:03:46.116
Well, this is...

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:49.200
As expected, it seems that it is not easy to find.

00:03:50.156 --> 00:03:52.156
The clue to the pot that Ozer was talking about is...

00:03:53.324 --> 00:03:54.324
That's right.

00:03:55.628 --> 00:03:56.128
Hello

00:03:56.908 --> 00:03:59.988
Red Hoshi Rezo's soul has found a sleeping pot.

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:01.150
I want you to crush it.

00:04:02.030 --> 00:04:04.580
A pot where the souls of those who know no evil sleep.

00:04:05.700 --> 00:04:08.940
Those who know no evil.

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:12.520
The so-called legendary sage, the blind magician.

00:04:14.090 --> 00:04:17.530
A person who saved many people with his unique magic and knowledge.

00:04:21.010 --> 00:04:27.720
And my benefactor, who put everyone who was affected by the plague to sleep and sealed them.

00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:37.780
However, that truth burned the belief in only fixing one's own eyes,

00:04:38.180 --> 00:04:53.710
and in exchange for opening one's blind eyes,

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:57.660
it revived the Demon King, and I was also destroyed.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:03.390
The pot where the soul of Rezo is sleeping is somewhere in this world.

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:07.090
Ah, that's why I have to find that pot.

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:10.190
In order to unseal the seal of my hometown, Tahorasia!

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:11.730
Yeah.

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:13.310
I see.

00:05:13.650 --> 00:05:18.380
That's all you need to do.

00:05:19.320 --> 00:05:20.590
What do you mean?

00:05:20.970 --> 00:05:22.720
There are still a lot of mysteries.

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:27.090
Why did Ozer say to destroy the pot where Rezo is sleeping?

00:05:28.730 --> 00:05:29.780
In the first place...

00:05:30.540 --> 00:05:31.080
Who was that Ozer?

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:34.900
How did he get involved with Rezo?

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:36.740
And one more thing.

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:40.860
It seems that Zeroth was also involved in this case.

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:42.690
At first, I thought it was because of Xanathar,

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:46.080
but it seems that he had nothing to do with it.

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:49.490
Um, is that a secret?

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:52.930
He's not a person who moves for no reason.

00:05:53.090 --> 00:05:56.200
Since he's moving, there must be a reason.

00:05:56.800 --> 00:05:58.020
It's like abandoning Xanathar.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:00.500
That's not a big deal.

00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:01.960
That's...

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:02.900
Um...

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:03.700
Is that something more troublesome than XANAFA?

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:07.560
If you continue like this, it might turn out like that.

00:06:42.990 --> 00:06:43.270
Excuse me.

00:06:43.350 --> 00:06:45.200
I brought you a meal.

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:53.470
How do you like it?

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:03.840
Even so, it's just a pot.

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:05.940
There seems to be no clue in the Great Library of the Seiren Magician Association.

00:07:09.600 --> 00:07:11.250
Where did you look for it?

00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:15.360
If you say it's a pot and you remember it, then...

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:23.800
Let go of the impurities of the body and entrust your soul to the pot.

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:37.590
Well, it's just about that pot we used when we became this body.

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:38.530
Huh?

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:42.770
Huh? Did something happen to you guys?

00:07:43.050 --> 00:07:43.570
Ouch!

00:07:44.110 --> 00:07:44.970
You idiot!

00:07:45.210 --> 00:07:48.280
I'll kill you!

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:51.900
What we were looking for was...

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:52.020
Huh?

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:53.910
You...

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:55.310
Seriously...

00:07:55.310 --> 00:07:59.200
If you use the sword of light, you can really absorb intelligence, can't you?

00:07:59.220 --> 00:07:59.920
No...

00:08:00.190 --> 00:08:01.570
That's not even close!

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:04.020
I'm not fucking with you!

00:08:05.810 --> 00:08:06.630
Is that so?

00:08:06.810 --> 00:08:11.960
I can't see a single one of them.

00:08:12.860 --> 00:08:17.830
Yeah, this is a place where Xanafra suffered a lot of damage.

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:21.010
So, going back to what we were talking about earlier,

00:08:21.170 --> 00:08:25.820
can you transfer a soul of a single human being to one of those pots?

00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:29.700
Yeah, Rezo told me about that pot...

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:30.880
He said it was the Great King's pot.

00:08:31.520 --> 00:08:32.670
The Great King...

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:34.700
The Great King Fibrizona?

00:08:34.900 --> 00:08:36.190
Hahahahaha!

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:42.130
It sounds like a name to change a person's soul.

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:46.040
If that's the case...

00:08:46.780 --> 00:08:48.880
If that Rezo had something on him...

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:52.020
I wonder if he was trying to change the soul of that pot.

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:54.680
I see.

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:56.360
So that's what it was.

00:08:56.780 --> 00:08:58.380
So, where do you sell that pot?

00:08:59.380 --> 00:08:59.860
Eh?

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:08.130
First of all, you have to go back to the castle of Jokonda and look for the places that are related to each other.

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:11.460
Is it me?

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:13.990
Don't say anything! Just work!

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:17.030
I'm not good at physical labor like this.

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:23.860
Is there really a pot like this?

00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:27.550
That's why I'm telling you. You have to look for them one by one.

00:09:28.570 --> 00:09:29.970
Tokota's hometown...

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:33.720
You can't get into Rafał Raszia's prison, so let's start by looking for him here.

00:09:33.720 --> 00:09:34.040
Here.

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:48.900
RISKORAN!

00:09:49.140 --> 00:09:56.670
I found him!

00:10:02.650 --> 00:10:05.750
It's supposed to be in the underground lab!

00:10:07.480 --> 00:10:08.280
No doubt!

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:12.400
Duclis was here!

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:14.320
I see.

00:10:14.580 --> 00:10:23.350
It seems that he was doing a pretty high-level research.

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:27.240
He was using the materials stolen from Taho Russia.

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:29.720
Let's go to the King of the Deceased together.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:30.780
There is a possibility that the pot was also brought out.

00:10:33.080 --> 00:10:34.420
This is...

00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:37.800
Did you try to create a Kouzuna Chimera and turn it into food?

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:39.580
Then...

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:40.560
Come on, come on.

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:42.360
You don't understand the feelings of Zell, do you?

00:10:42.920 --> 00:10:44.760
Now look for the pot of honor.

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:46.780
I know.

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:04.740
Hey!

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:05.330
Hey!

00:11:05.670 --> 00:11:05.750
Hey!

00:11:11.820 --> 00:11:12.300
BINGO!

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:20.070
I didn't know there was more to this place.

00:11:20.190 --> 00:11:22.080
Did he hide something?

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:24.360
Did he seal something?

00:11:30.380 --> 00:11:45.300
Wait, will there be a demon or a devil?

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:46.720
A singing demon!

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:56.140
A beautiful rose has thorns, just like me!

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:58.940
What's with that reaction?

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:02.660
It seems that the song can be heard from there.

00:12:03.100 --> 00:12:03.860
Let's go!

00:12:04.100 --> 00:12:04.360
Yes!

00:12:04.520 --> 00:12:27.140
It's a armor, isn't it?

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:28.020
What is it?

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:29.020
A armor in a place like this?

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:30.140
I'm going to go to the next room.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:00.640
It's hot!

00:13:01.560 --> 00:13:04.440
It might be a clue to the King of the Deceased.

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:06.920
What are you doing all of a sudden?

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:10.030
My body is moving due to the condition reflection.

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:12.650
Condition reflection?

00:13:13.050 --> 00:13:14.450
It looks empty inside.

00:13:15.030 --> 00:13:20.200
Huh? I heard the voice from the armor.

00:13:21.380 --> 00:13:22.360
I think so.

00:13:23.140 --> 00:13:24.040
But look.

00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:25.410
What do you mean?

00:13:25.730 --> 00:13:26.800
It's strange.

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:29.140
It's true that the answer is...

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:32.980
W-weapons?

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:33.800
It's up!

00:13:34.140 --> 00:13:45.890
What's going on?

00:13:46.210 --> 00:13:46.860
It hurts!

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:51.750
Poon-poon?

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:53.370
This is...

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:55.720
Hmph, so it's called a living armor.

00:13:56.460 --> 00:13:57.400
Living...

00:13:58.900 --> 00:13:59.360
Um...

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:00.360
What is that?

00:14:00.660 --> 00:14:02.200
Living armor.

00:14:03.010 --> 00:14:06.720
It is a armor that is blown into life by some means and moves around with one's own will.

00:14:07.620 --> 00:14:09.550
Is that a means?

00:14:10.270 --> 00:14:13.930
Is that the king's horn?

00:14:14.190 --> 00:14:15.780
Hey, you!

00:14:16.060 --> 00:14:17.990
Do you want to talk to someone who suddenly did something painful?

00:14:19.510 --> 00:14:23.350
It looks like you're angry, Rina-san!

00:14:23.760 --> 00:14:29.180
Well, if a suspicious armor sings a song and then laughs at it, that's one of the attacks.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:33.300
I don't know what to do with you, but you're not cute.

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:36.510
Really? I think I'm pretty cute.

00:14:37.030 --> 00:14:40.220
Okay, okay. I'm sorry I attacked you.

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:45.280
So let me talk to you. Who are you?

00:14:46.010 --> 00:14:46.930
Who am I?

00:14:55.100 --> 00:14:56.700
Anyway, your name is Naama, right?

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:02.260
That's a little too much.

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:05.810
I don't give a damn about your name.

00:15:05.870 --> 00:15:07.930
Anyway, don't you know anything about Tsubo?

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:09.760
Tsubo?

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:12.070
Well...

00:15:12.070 --> 00:15:15.080
I don't know anything about him!

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:35.060
I was out of my mind, and when I woke up, I was singing a song here.

00:15:35.440 --> 00:15:36.680
I did it, so why sing?

00:15:37.280 --> 00:15:39.780
Because it's lonely to be alone, isn't it?

00:15:40.260 --> 00:15:40.720
Is that so?

00:15:41.300 --> 00:15:45.990
Anyway, that means you were originally a normal person, not a living armor, right?

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:49.100
Normal?

00:15:50.250 --> 00:15:53.870
It's like a voice I've heard somewhere, like a voice I don't want to remember.

00:15:54.910 --> 00:15:55.750
What's wrong?

00:15:56.690 --> 00:15:58.470
The voice of that Nama is...

00:16:00.190 --> 00:16:01.350
No way...

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:04.180
What!? You knew him!?

00:16:04.660 --> 00:16:07.960
Well, his voice and the way he talks are completely different.

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:12.340
His voice? Well, if it's just his voice, there are quite a few people who look like him.

00:16:13.040 --> 00:16:17.860
Ah! Could it be that Naama-san's parents and siblings knew each other!?

00:16:18.810 --> 00:16:20.350
Brothers, huh...

00:16:20.350 --> 00:16:23.620
Well, if there are parents and siblings in that armor, I'd like to see it.

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:25.720
Hmm...

00:16:25.720 --> 00:16:29.030
It seems that there is an obstacle in his memory.

00:16:30.320 --> 00:16:30.920
I don't know if it's because of Meio's pot.

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:34.280
W-Where did you find that pot?

00:16:35.060 --> 00:16:36.090
Is it in this underground tunnel?

00:16:36.590 --> 00:16:37.480
Is it a place?

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:41.830
Naaah!

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:45.150
Get out of the way!

00:16:45.370 --> 00:16:49.250
No, I can't do anything about this guy.

00:16:51.210 --> 00:16:51.910
Eeeh!

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:53.330
Eeeh!

00:16:53.370 --> 00:16:57.780
Something's wrong.

00:16:58.120 --> 00:16:59.960
It's a slipper, isn't it?

00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:17.240
I'm sorry for the trouble. I won't do this anymore!

00:17:17.380 --> 00:17:21.160
If you're going to rub your head on the ground, I won't tell you anything.

00:17:22.360 --> 00:17:24.300
Wh-What did you say?!

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:26.540
So it's fine, but...

00:17:26.880 --> 00:17:29.000
You should look for a place to hide and wander around.

00:17:30.410 --> 00:17:30.990
Hey, Ina.

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:33.430
Ah, you've become an adult here.

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:35.390
Who's going to lower the bar?

00:17:35.630 --> 00:17:36.410
To such a villain.

00:17:36.810 --> 00:17:37.530
You're a villain.

00:17:38.430 --> 00:17:40.860
If you say that, I won't be able to keep up with you.

00:17:41.380 --> 00:17:42.920
I'll let you keep up with me.

00:17:43.480 --> 00:17:44.140
That's funny.

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:46.860
I'm going to get rid of Tsubo-no-Arika by force.

00:17:47.800 --> 00:17:48.160
Well.

00:17:49.390 --> 00:17:50.450
It's really a matter of remembering Tsubo-no-Arika.

00:17:52.510 --> 00:17:53.070
Giggle.

00:17:53.690 --> 00:17:54.750
It's obvious that you remember that.

00:17:55.810 --> 00:17:57.150
It's a game.

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:02.690
What a convenient guy.

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:05.050
You're such a pain in the ass!

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:08.520
I'll take care of that right now!

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:12.960
I'll take care of that right now!

00:18:13.100 --> 00:18:14.960
Hey, you don't have to stop me.

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:18.240
Well, if you do, I won't be able to stop you.

00:18:19.590 --> 00:18:22.030
But why does Rina have to get so angry?

00:18:23.050 --> 00:18:25.000
I wonder if it's a good match.

00:18:25.460 --> 00:18:28.110
I hope they don't get hurt or something.

00:18:35.820 --> 00:18:49.490
I'm not going anywhere!

00:18:50.010 --> 00:18:52.270
I'm not going anywhere!

00:19:01.400 --> 00:19:01.680
FLEE-!

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:03.160
FLEE-!

00:19:03.300 --> 00:19:08.460
FLEE-!

00:19:09.530 --> 00:19:09.790
FLEE-!

00:19:09.850 --> 00:19:25.600
If I just do the curse like I always do, I'll be back soon.

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:27.310
In a way, I'm worse than Zanaffar!

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:29.550
So...

00:19:30.860 --> 00:19:31.380
What do you think about it?

00:19:31.800 --> 00:19:33.540
If you don't come out, I'll stop you!

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:36.080
PING!

00:19:36.420 --> 00:19:37.360
The blade that holds the freezing soul

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:39.720
I can't give it to you

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:41.800
This is the first move!

00:19:42.020 --> 00:19:42.980
Shigenpo!

00:19:56.020 --> 00:19:57.220
The feeling of becoming a magnet of friendship

00:19:57.220 --> 00:19:57.640
What?

00:20:00.830 --> 00:20:04.230
After being hit by lightning, your metal body has become a magnet!

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:08.000
That fake body is A.D.E.!

00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:11.910
Come on, melt that iron shard again, and I'll make you into something really bad!

00:20:13.310 --> 00:20:17.990
Something darker than the twilight, something redder than the flow of death!

00:20:18.250 --> 00:20:23.200
I will be buried in the flow of time, and I will go into darkness!

00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:25.050
Leave me alone!

00:20:25.270 --> 00:20:27.310
He doesn't have any sense of propriety at all!

00:20:27.750 --> 00:20:28.270
Then...

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:29.820
In front of us...

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:30.940
I'm not going to let you get away with this.

00:20:54.460 --> 00:20:54.660
I'm not going to let you get away with this.

00:20:54.920 --> 00:20:58.300
It's not working.

00:21:00.380 --> 00:21:08.020
What are you going to do? Are you still motivated?

00:21:08.380 --> 00:21:12.440
I'm sure.

00:21:12.940 --> 00:21:15.520
If you say something like that, it's really annoying.

00:21:16.560 --> 00:21:27.710
Please be patient for a while now.

00:21:30.800 --> 00:21:32.280
Until the new arm gets used to it.

00:21:32.650 --> 00:21:33.870
Lina...

00:21:33.870 --> 00:21:34.270
Huh?

00:21:34.620 --> 00:21:36.980
Lina, lower the level of the Inverse.

00:21:37.340 --> 00:21:38.810
I understand.

00:21:39.390 --> 00:21:40.650
I have a request...

00:21:40.650 --> 00:21:42.280
I have a request for two days.

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:45.130
As the starting point of this arm...

00:21:45.130 --> 00:21:47.160
No matter what kind of request it is...

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:48.580
I don't care who it is...
